# blaze-sim's kept failing tapes (docs/v2/plan/design/test.md, piece S3), compiled in by
# `blaze_sim::sim_kept!()` and replayed first by `blaze_sim::check_kept`.
# One line a tape, as a failure's report prints it after `blaze-sim keep: `:
#   <test path> v<primitives version> <tape>  # <date> <one line why>
# Lines are only added; a line whose test is renamed moves to the new path.
